  "notes": "{検察官|けんさつかん} is the official term for a prosecutor in Japan.\n\nRELATED LEGAL TERMS:\n- {弁護士|べんごし} (lawyer, defense attorney)\n- {裁判官|さいばんかん} (judge)\n- {被告人|ひこくにん} (defendant)\n- {原告|げんこく} (plaintiff)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {検察官|けんさつかん}の{論告|ろんこく} (prosecutor's closing argument)\n- {検察官|けんさつかん}による{起訴|きそ} (indictment by prosecutor)",
